  description: Earth is the third planet from the Sun and the only planet currently
    known to support life. Its surface contains vast oceans and continents, while
    its atmosphere provides oxygen and helps regulate temperatures necessary for
    living organisms.
  interestingFact: About 71% of Earth's surface is covered by water, and most of
    that water is found in the oceans.
